{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415485","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415485","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041548501:1":{"text":"あら！こんな所にババリアの勇士がいるじゃない！","source_cn":"嘿！我看到了谁？又一位蛮血勇士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5301D856C8D1011E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548502:1":{"text":"戦歌祭の審判として、このマンカラが、あなたを次の戦歌祭に招待するわ！","source_cn":"作为战歌节的裁判，曼卡拉向你发出郑重的邀请——请你来参...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD24D0C2F1844D3CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548503:1":{"text":"ええ？戦歌祭？","source_cn":"啊……战歌节？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC17AB30EBBF0F2C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548504:1":{"text":"ええ、戦歌祭よ！荒涼の砂漠で開かれる、ババリアの盛大なイベントよ！力を証明する栄えある戦場なの！","source_cn":"没错，战歌节！在荒角沙漠上举办的、属于蛮血的盛大节日！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CF5EC1EA0C37CD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548505:1":{"text":"もしかして聞いたことない？ババリアなら誰だって知ってるはずなのに……","source_cn":"每个蛮血都应该知道！难道你没有听说过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4FAA151A36EC722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548506:1":{"text":"ああ、久しぶりに聞いたから、確認しただけだべ。","source_cn":"不，我只是太久没有听到这个词，确认一下而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7504F0204DFCC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548507:1":{"text":"ごめんねえ、ウチは戦歌祭に興味ないんだ。","source_cn":"抱歉，亲爱的，我对战歌节没兴趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8E734E2BAAF4E6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548508:1":{"text":"それに、荒涼の砂漠には何年も帰ってないし、戻るつもりもないから……","source_cn":"实不相瞒，我已经离开荒角沙漠很多年了，也不准备再回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CA472A63DD32345","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548509:1":{"text":"えぇっ！？あなたみたいな勇士が、戦歌祭の招待を断るというの！？ババリアなら誰もが憧れる最高の栄誉なのよ！","source_cn":"我听到了什么？！像你这样的天生的勇士，居然拒绝了战歌节...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D2F2C0ADA0A95A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548510:1":{"text":"あなたほどの才能があれば、たとえ最後の勝者になれなくても、間違いなく素晴らしい成績を収められるわ！","source_cn":"凭借你的天赋——曼卡拉有预感——即使不能获得最终的胜利...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE35B6E198B04F049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548511:1":{"text":"本当に参加する気はないの？きっと観客たちが大歓声で迎えてくれるわよ！","source_cn":"真的不来试试吗？战歌节的观众会用最热烈的掌声欢迎你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF588BE8C79C9066B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548512:1":{"text":"ごめんねえ。力で勝ち取った栄光よりも、穏やかな暮らしの方が性に合ってるんだよ。","source_cn":"比起用力量获得的荣誉，我更想过平静的日子。抱歉啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42B0900F7849A9DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548513:1":{"text":"でも、戦歌祭のスポンサーの相談なら、いつでも大歓迎だべ。","source_cn":"不过，如果战歌节需要赞助商的话，或许我们可以聊一聊哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EBDB0FFDAB29C14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041548514:1":{"text":"……え？","source_cn":"……哎？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5D39E679BC4EBB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"マンカラ","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"ガルダ","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}